    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah but the \"healing\" is temporary. i see people fight so hard to stay alive just to go back to the same misery, or they die anyway. it feels like i'm just prolonging the inevitable. sometimes i look at them and think... why are we even doing this? why do we bother fighting for anything at all? it just feels like a losing game.",
